nity workshop features, you can share your masterpieces with other robotics geniuses, or download others\u2019 robots for inspiration and remixing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067220/extras/4b04f58f043f2ed86b75f5a93e5e2a4b.poster.avif?t=1770394097\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067220/extras/4b04f58f043f2ed86b75f5a93e5e2a4b.webm?t=1770394097\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067220/extras/4b04f58f043f2ed86b75f5a93e5e2a4b.mp4?t=1770394097\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Filament Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067220/450bd8559081d1c1c597d30d7b3498ba46c4d603/header.jpg?t=1770394097","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2022 RoboCo LLC. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1067220/2078120094/2761d9322e3e8e4a7630dd9c325536fe3522a12d/1770331188/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770332223","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1067220/2078120094/2761d9322e3e8e4a7630dd9c325536fe3522a12d/1770331188/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770332223","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_traile